h","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草へ向かってる最中でございます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草へいくのも、スカイツリーへ行くのも初めてでした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雷門から浅草寺までの仲見世で美味しいものを食べました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お団子に、人形焼に、、、いろいろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来立ての人形焼が美味しすぎて、自分用お土産にも買いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5D6E4X3E0M61KQNQ6R9WE","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、お母さんおみくじを引くと言ったので私もおみくじ引きました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH5D7F3BQRKFY0MQA3M05C4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"彼女がおみくじなうに使っていいですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おみくじは末吉でした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度は花やしきに行きたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草がすごく好きになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浅草歩いていたら、修学旅行の沖縄を思い出しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スカイツリーにも登って、高いところに行きたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京巡り、楽しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","te